		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Seafoam-clad fey maiden with long, froth-coated hair. Ocean nymph.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 24, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 touch +2 (1d4) or 1 waterspout (far) +4 (3d6), <strong>MV</strong> near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Water Dependent</strong>. Must be submerged in water every 4 hours or suffocates.</p><p></p><p><strong>Water Telekinesis</strong>. Far range. As an action, control water to move a creature or object near distance in any direction and hold it in place. Opposed CHA versus STR if unwilling.</p><p></p><p><strong>Waveglide</strong>. Control ocean, double or half movement of creatures or objects within double near.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
